    "description": "LOST & FOUND is a pack of 10 animated, ready-to-use error pages — 404, 500, 503 maintenance, 403 and offline — in clean HTML, CSS and JavaScript. Each page is a single file: change your colours and links, upload it, done.",
    "details": "Turn the most ignored page of your website into a moment people remember.\n\nLOST & FOUND is a pack of 10 animated, ready-to-use error pages — 404, 500, 503 maintenance, 403 and offline — built in clean HTML, CSS and JavaScript. Each page is a single file: open it, change your colors and links, upload it. No coding, no frameworks, no plugins.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ THE 10 PAGES\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n01 ORBIT · 404 — starfield with mouse parallax and a floating planet\n02 TERMINAL · 404 — interactive command line: visitors type help, ls, home, back\n03 GLITCH · 500 — RGB glitch effect, incident ID, auto-retry countdown\n04 WORKSHOP · 503 — maintenance page with live countdown and status checklist\n05 EDITORIAL · 404 — minimal luxury layout with site search and popular links\n06 AURORA · 404 — animated gradient, glass card with 3D tilt\n07 SIGNAL · Offline — reconnects automatically (service worker included)\n08 VAULT · 403 — laser scan and animated lock, sign-in & request access\n09 EDITOR · 404 — code editor that types the error live\n10 BUG RUN · 404 — a playable mini-game with saved high score\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ WHAT'S INCLUDED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✓ 10 animated error pages (single HTML files)\n✓ Live gallery to preview and compare all pages\n✓ Step-by-step setup guide (START-HERE.html)\n✓ Ready-made configs: Apache .htaccess, Nginx, Netlify, Vercel, Node/Express\n✓ Offline service worker for web apps (PWA)\n✓ License for your own and your clients' websites\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ FEATURES\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n• Fully responsive — phone, tablet, desktop\n• Easy to customize — colors, texts and links in clearly marked boxes\n• No dependencies, works at any URL depth\n• Respects \"reduce motion\" accessibility settings\n• noindex included so error pages stay out of search results\n• Optional Google Font — remove one line for zero external requests\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ WORKS WITH\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nNetlify · Vercel · GitHub Pages · cPanel / Apache hosting · Nginx · WordPress (404.php) · Node / Express · any static host\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ HOW IT WORKS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1. Download the ZIP file after purchase\n2. Open index.html to choose your pages\n3. Edit colors and links in any text editor\n4. Rename to 404.html and upload — the guide shows where for your host\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✦ PLEASE NOTE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n• This is a DIGITAL DOWNLOAD. No physical item will be shipped.\n• You need your own website/hosting to install the pages.\n• Website builders that don't allow custom HTML error pages (some Wix or Squarespace plans) may not support installation.\n• License: use on unlimited websites you own and on client websites. Reselling or sharing the files as templates is not allowed.\n• Designed by VelvetDigitalLabb with the help of AI tools, then tested and refined by hand.",
