    "details": "A complete website for a software product, app or startup: 3 finished home pages and 10 inner pages, all designed together. Open it, change the words, put it online.\n\nNothing to assemble. Every page is already built, so you only replace the text with your own.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nWHAT YOU GET\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✔ 3 complete home pages, pick the one you like:\n   • Split: headline on the left, animated live dashboard on the right\n   • Stage: centred headline, dashboard on stage below\n   • Night shift: dark design, email signup, streaming live log\n✔ 10 ready inner pages: Features, Pricing, Status page, Blog, Article, Log in, Privacy & Terms, 404, plus an illustrated Start Here guide\n✔ 15 optional extra sections for later (testimonials, team, integrations, FAQ…)\n✔ 8 colour themes. Change one word in one file and all 13 pages follow\n✔ Light and dark mode on every page, remembered for each visitor\n✔ Pricing page with a monthly / yearly switch and a 17-row comparison table\n✔ Animations in plain JavaScript, no plugins or libraries\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nBUILT PROPERLY\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✔ Responsive: looks right on phones, tablets and desktops\n✔ Fonts included in the download: works offline and makes no requests to Google\n✔ SEO and social-sharing tags already on every page, plus sitemap.xml and robots.txt\n✔ Keyboard accessible, and respects visitors who turn off animations\n✔ No npm, no build step, no framework. Just HTML, CSS and JavaScript files\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nHOW IT WORKS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1. Download the ZIP and unzip it\n2. Open start-here.html in your browser: it shows you every step\n3. Change the words in any free text editor (VS Code, TextEdit…)\n4. Pick one of the 8 colour themes: change one word in config.css\n5. Drag the folder onto Netlify Drop (free) and your site is online\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nGOOD FOR\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n• SaaS products, apps and tech startups\n• Freelancers and agencies building sites for clients\n• Developers who want a polished starting point\n• Anyone launching a software product who wants a professional site fast\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPLEASE NOTE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n• This is a digital download. No physical item will be shipped.\n• This is an HTML/CSS template. It is NOT a WordPress theme, a Wix/Squarespace template or a Canva file.\n• You need a text editor (free) to change the words. No coding tools or installation needed.\n• Signup and login forms are visual demos. To collect real emails, connect a free form service (the guide shows how).\n• All names, logos, people and numbers in the demo are placeholders to replace with your own.\n• Designed and built with the help of AI tools, then reviewed and tested by hand on desktop and mobile.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nLICENCE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✔ Use it for your own websites\n✔ Use it for client websites\n✔ Modify it as much as you like\n✘ Do not resell or share the template files themselves\n\nFonts included: Bricolage Grotesque and Figtree, free licence (SIL Open Font License, copy included).",
